      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِدْمَاجَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A turban;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِمَامَةٌ</span>; (AHeyth,
K;) a rare instance of the addition of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span> to the
measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِفْعَالٌ</span>: or it seems to be an epithet
applied to a turban, meaning <i>firmly wound.</i>
(AHeyth.)

